# Auth for `bun publish` to the @urbicon registry (Codeberg).
# Unlike bun install (bunfig.toml), bun publish does NOT read the token from
# bunfig.toml, hence the authToken line here. Just a reference to $CODEBERG_TOKEN
# from the environment/.env — NOT a secret. (Bun interpolates $VAR, not ${VAR}.)
//codeberg.org/api/packages/urbicon/npm/:_authToken=$CODEBERG_TOKEN
